{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-signin-springfestival",
  "id": "source-25600",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "25600001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "今晚的夜色真美，忍不住想要跳一支舞呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "我想请你做我的观众，仅有的唯一一位观众哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "告诉我，你从我的舞蹈里看到了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25600005",
              "text": "「舞如莲旋」"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "25600005",
              "text": "「转袖飞雪」"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25600004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "唔，这是所有见过我跳舞的人都会讲的话呢，听起来真是亲切。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "让我想起了很小很小的时候，那时的我住在美丽的乡下，几乎没有什么朋友。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "山野的生活非常美好，可是却太寂寞了——你能体会那种感觉吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "每逢满月夜，那种让人彻骨寒冷的感觉，现在想想还是让我发抖呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25600010",
              "text": "现在的你还有这种感觉吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25600009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "在遇到你之前，偶尔也会有的哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "与你相遇之后，一种从未有过的温暖像一阵春风，吹散了所有的阴霾。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "现在的我在今天这样的晚上，觉得非常幸福。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "25600014",
              "text": "真是太好了。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "25600013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "你不想知道这是为什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我在等你开口。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "呵呵，时机足够成熟的话，我会把心里话讲出来的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25600017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "貂蝉",
          "text": "在那之前，请好好地欣赏这一支月色下的独舞吧~❤",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
